---
description: Animal Audio monorepo overview, build/test commands and branding
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root first; it is the source of truth (layout, commands, conventions, branding,
adding a plugin). Keep it updated when you change those things.

- Stack: JUCE 8 + CMake + C++17, VST3 plugins in `plugins/<name>/`, shared code in `shared/dsp` (JUCE-free) and `shared/ui`.
- Build/test: `cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja && cmake --build build && ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure`
- New plugin: `python3 scripts/new_plugin.py <PascalName> --description "..."`
- Branding: "Animal Audio" wordmark (`BrandBadge`) on every plugin UI; playful but clean; no third-party assets or branding.
- Run `scripts/format.sh` before committing C++.
